{"steam_appid":1861440,"steam_name":"CLeM","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1861440/658814/da5c953440158ea2978936b8598d31a122af69f7/1751039628/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1707235170","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256998936/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1707235170","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/ss_53c296fc1c9bd22630cbb870a219d1bbdbf4e229.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772458059","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/ss_8556d128efd26955141476c59c04256164f6b75e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772458059","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/ss_2742c1f9a81f3bb2a5f88413cfb89ce813235031.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772458059","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/ss_5e810a17b6fefec6f3a0c9c295abe382148b1974.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772458059","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/ss_3b74044a57e1cb96ab83d6fbc5f9c09776245c82.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772458059"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/b5657e264dbcf3686451a095aa84b4e7.webp?t=1772458059\" width=476 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a cold, dimly lit room, your senses slowly adjusting to the surroundings that, oddly, feel familiar. A strange sensation lingers in you, reminding you that something is not quite right. As you find your bearings, your attention is drawn to a peculiar item on the ground. A notebook labeled &quot;CLeM&quot; lies before you. As you delve into its pages, covered with intricate sketches of insects accompanied by vague symbols, you find a note containing a cryptic message: “Bring me BEAUTY.” Lost in deciphering the contents, a voice interrupts your focus.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/fe8b97ae7f78c79e999bdbd14e3d517c.poster.avif?t=1772458059\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/fe8b97ae7f78c79e999bdbd14e3d517c.webm?t=1772458059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/fe8b97ae7f78c79e999bdbd14e3d517c.mp4?t=1772458059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/f47145a5f0892bdc4b9f47ada31473cc.webp?t=1772458059\" width=345 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles intertwine with exploration, weaving a unique narrative experience we call “Puzzlevania” with a shadowy story to unravel and countless challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/85d97d8a019a2acc8b488c8ceec6ffdc.poster.avif?t=1772458059\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/85d97d8a019a2acc8b488c8ceec6ffdc.webm?t=1772458059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/85d97d8a019a2acc8b488c8ceec6ffdc.mp4?t=1772458059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/e6f136b3614a569cac43797392637abc.webp?t=1772458059\" width=452 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft magic toys to unveil hidden secrets, access unreachable spots, and reclaim items from the past as you uncover new revelations in familiar spaces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/2f94542bb78b2a0028e2a2131430a776.poster.avif?t=1772458059\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/2f94542bb78b2a0028e2a2131430a776.webm?t=1772458059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/2f94542bb78b2a0028e2a2131430a776.mp4?t=1772458059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/b516c49a2df61a91d3c757eb22de27df.webp?t=1772458059\" width=338 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a seemingly desolate house accompanied only by an obscure voice and a notebook full of annotations and drawings on alchemy, insects, and other creepy crawlies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/9b092a610236069e204b3d91d54192bb.poster.avif?t=1772458059\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/9b092a610236069e204b3d91d54192bb.webm?t=1772458059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/9b092a610236069e204b3d91d54192bb.mp4?t=1772458059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861440/extras/8b75f84e798d44afc84e00cc0b26585b.webp?t=1772458059\" width=235 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your fate in this dark story of manipulation, pride, forgiveness, and redemption. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new genre, “Puzzlevania,” intertwines puzzles and exploration. Discover hidden secrets in each room as you delve deeper into the mysteries with every crafted magical toy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and beautiful art style with hand-drawn elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D graphics with 3D environmental navigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging and diverse puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enigmatic story with a dark turn.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Mango Protocol"],"publishers":["Iceberg Interactive"],"release_date":"6 Feb, 2024","metacritic_score":79}